    "chunk_text": ", & \u00fea geornlice beweop & bereowsede, He geneosode Romeburh seofe si\u00f0en Criste to lofe & Seinte Petre, & \u00fe\u00e6re his synnen forgyfenysse He w\u00e6s on eallen Godes beboden swy\u00f0e fullfremed. Sohte \u00fea weste stowe geond eall \u00feiss land on to wunigene, & \u00fea gemette he \u00feurh Godes foresceawunge. Seo is w\u00e6std\u00e6les \u00feysses landes, ten milen fram Petrocesstowe \u00fea me hatt Neotes stoca. & he him \u00fe\u00e6r wununge getimbrode on swy\u00f0e f\u00e6geren stowe, & myrige w\u00e6tersea\u00f0es \u00fe\u00e6r abuten \u00de\u00e6r se Godes \u00feeowe Sanctus Neotus his lif adreah on mycelre forh\u00e6fednysse, ofer m\u00e6n o\u00f0re modes & Ne m\u00e6ig nan mann fullice gecy\u00f0en, hwu sti\u00f0lice he his lif adreah \u00e6r his m\u00e6ssepreosthade ne \u00e6fter. Ne gl\u00e6ingde he his lichame mid deorewur\u00f0en scrude, ne he mid estmeten his inna\u00f0 ne gefyllde. Mid \u00fean \u00fee he \u00feuss lange gedrohtned h\u00e6fde on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe, \u00fee we won \u00e6r fore s\u00e6den, \u00fea ongann se Ongann \u00fea s\u00e6nden his \u00e6ttrige w\u00e6pnen, \u00fe\u00e6t synd costnungen, togeanes \u00fean halgen were. Ac he \u00feone feond oferswa\u00f0 mid rihten geleafen \u00feurh Godes gescyldnysse. Him comen gelomen to halige Godes \u00e6ngles and hine gefrefreden & wel geherten, & hine manoden, He dyde swa se \u00e6ngel bebead. Bodede ealle mannen rihtne geleafe. \u00dean synfullen & \u00fean \u00fee heora synnen andetten wolden & \u00e6fre",
